<title>USA: Medstone Q3 shr $0.05 vs $0.22.</title>
<headline>Medstone Q3 shr $0.05 vs $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>ALISO VIEJO, Calif. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medstone International Inc</p>
<p>					   For the three months ended</p>
<p>				     Sep 30, 1996	 Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   $ 4,348,750     $ 5,283,717(a)</p>
<p> Income before taxes		1,342,265	    1,862,108</p>
<p> Net income			     812,386	    1,211,108</p>
<p>Net income per share:</p>
<p>  Primary				     .15		    .22</p>
<p>  Fully diluted			     .15		    .21</p>
