<p>  Primary			     5,528,594	    5,538,913</p>
<p>  Fully diluted			     N/A	    5,704,439</p>
<p>(a)  Includes $161,455 of revenues from Endocare that Medstone spun-out at the end of fiscal year 1995. (b)  Includes a $5.5 million settlement expense. (c)  Includes $749,191 of revenues from Endocare that Medstone spun-out at the end of fiscal year 1995.</p>
